, 2Sam 4:7 ; 2Kin 6:12 ; Eccl 10:20 ; other combinations: &#8212; ׳ח הַמְּקֵרָה Judg 3:24 = cool chamber ; ׳ח הַמְּנִימִים 1Chr 28:11 inner chamber ; מַשְׂכִּיתוֺ חדרי Ezek 8:12 his chambers of imagery (strike out Hi Co Sgfrom); ׳ח ׳בְּח a chamber within a chamber , i.e. an innermost chamber 1Kin 20:30 ; 22:25 2Chr 18:24 ; 2Kin 9:2 ; plural = store-rooms Prov 24:4 ; so ׳ח הַמִּטּוֺת 2Kin 11:2 2Chr 22:11 , i.e. room where beds were stored (Ke Th); metaphor מָ֑וֶת ׳ח Prov 7:27 (|| שְׁאוֺל דַּרְכֵי ); תֵּמָן חדרי Job 9:9 chambers of south (where constellations are treasured up, see Di; Hoffm. thinks of proper name of star or constellation); compare 37:9 a chamber whence comes storm-wind ( סוּפָה ); בֶטֶן חַדְרֵי i.e. inner parts of body, only figurative Prov 18:8 = 26:22 ; 20:27 , 30 ; in Deut 32:25 מֵחֲדָרִים = within , poetic for מִבַּיִת , || מִחוּץ without.","rootNote":"from 2314 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 28 11","keyReferences":["1Chr 28 11","1Kgs 1 15","1Kgs 20 30","1Kgs 20 30","1Kgs 22 25","1Kgs 22 25","2Chr 18 24","2Chr 18 24"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":38,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 28 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲדָרָ֥י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חַ֔דְרָ/ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa/Sd"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֶ֥דֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חָֽדֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֶ֥דֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter